"DJI Introduces Ronin 2, A More Powerful, Versatile and Intelligent Stabilizer for Film and Video Professionals (https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/dji-introduces-ronin-2-a-more-powerful-versatile-and-intelligent-stabilizer-for-film-and-video-professionals-300443974.html)\nciteturn8search0 [wordlim: 200] Published: 9.5 years ago; Crawled: 2 months ago; LAS VEGAS, April 23, 2017 /PRNewswire/ -- DJI, the world's leader in creative camera technology, Sunday introduced Ronin 2, the three-axis camera stabilizer redesigned to give filmmakers the freedom to capture any scene they can imagine.\n\n# DJI Introduces Ronin 2, A More Powerful, Versatile and Intelligent Stabilizer for Film and Video Professionals\n\nRedesigned Three-Axis Stabilized Gimbal System Lets Professionals Capture Smooth, Steady Footage in Every Situation\n\n* * *\n\n[Input]\n\n## News provided by\n\nDJI\n\nApr 23, 2017, 21:15 ET\n\n* * *\n\nLAS VEGAS, April 23, 2017 /PRNewswire/ -- DJI, the world's leader in creative camera technology, Sunday introduced Ronin 2, the three-axis camera stabilizer redesigned to give filmmakers the freedom to capture any scene they can imagine. Based on DJI's transformative gimbal technology, Ronin 2 has more power and torque to carry larger cameras, is more versatile to be used in every situation, and has more intelligent features to allow for unprecedented camera moves that help realize every creative vision.\n\n\"Ronin 2 dramatically improves every aspect of the camera operating experience and is the best stabilizer we have ever made,\" said Paul Pan, DJI Senior Product Manager. \"Completely redesigned to meet the needs of today's camera professionals, Ronin 2 makes it easier than ever to capture stunning cinematic footage under the widest variety of situations.\"\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nDJI: NEW: Introducing DJI Ronin 4D | Milled (https://milled.com/dji/new-introducing-dji-ronin-4d-54kmVUrXIYpIAEm7)\nciteturn8search1 [wordlim: 200] Published: 5.0 years ago; Crawled: 2 weeks ago; # NEW: Introducing DJI Ronin 4D ... Image October 20, 2021 10:41am EDT ... # Ronin 4D integrates 8K cinematic imaging, 4-axis stabilization, LiDAR focusing, and 20,000-foot video transmission into one filmmaking solution.\n\nDJI\n\nUS · dji.com\n\n# NEW: Introducing DJI Ronin 4D\n\n## 4-Axis Cinema Camera\n\nThis email was sent\n\nImage October 20, 2021 10:41am EDT\n\n4-Axis Cinema Camera\n\n# Ronin 4D integrates 8K cinematic imaging, 4-axis stabilization, LiDAR focusing, and 20,000-foot video transmission into one filmmaking solution.\n\nImage: Cinematic Imaging\n\n# Cinematic Imaging\n\nThe full-frame X9 gimbal camera can internally record in 8K/75fps RAW, and supports 14+ stops of dynamic range and dual native ISO. It also has 9-stop built-in ND filters.\nImage: 4-Axis Stabilization\n\n# 4-Axis Stabilization\n\nThe Z-axis effectively eliminates vertical camera shake and works with visual sensors and ActiveTrack Pro to let you create smooth, stable footage effortlessly.\nImage: LiDAR Focusing\n\n# LiDAR Focusing\n\nAutofocus is fast, accurate, and reliable even in low-lit environments, and is now available on manual lenses. LiDAR Waveform makes manual focusing more intuitive and convenient. Automated Manual Focus delivers an unrivaled focusing experience.\nImage: Wireless Transmission and Control\n\n# Wireless Transmission and Control\n\nO3 Pro Video Transmission technology adds DFS frequency bands and enables 1080p/60fps video transmission. It supports one transmitter with multiple receivers and can remotely control gimbal, focusing, and camera settings.\nLearn More--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nDJI Ronin 4D 8K | PetaPixel (https://petapixel.com/pixelmeter/dji-ronin-4d-8k/)\nciteturn8search2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; # DJI Ronin 4D 8K\n\nAnnounced October 20, 2021\n\n## Specifications\n\n### General\n\nAnnouncement date  